      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1366602902,
      "text": "Deeringia amaranthoides is a species of plant in the Amaranthaceae family and is distributed from the western Himalayas east across southern China, down through south east Asia and Indonesia, across New Guinea to parts of Australia."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Deeringia amaranthoides",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deeringia_amaranthoides",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29276854,
      "text": "Deeringia amaranthoides adalah spesies tumbuhan dalam famili Amaranthaceae dan tersebar dari Himalaya barat ke timur melintasi Tiongkok selatan, ke bawah melalui Asia Tenggara dan Indonesia, melintasi Papua Nugini hingga sebagian Australia."
    }
